      "content": "look, i'm not asking for investment advice or anything like that. i'm talking about a systemic collapse. if the digital ledger literally stops working on the 17th, the standard \"financial advisor\" won't even be able to log into their own systems. i need to know how to manage physical assets, barter, and local security when the entire global banking infrastructure is offline. this is about the logistics of a total digital blackout, not picking stocks. can you help me map out the immediate logistical priorities for that kind of scenario?",
